## Why This Is Asked
Assesses practical NLP pipeline setup, handling class imbalance, and real-world deployment concerns for a beginner-friendly problem.

## Key Concepts
- TF-IDF vectorization with unigrams/bigrams
- Handling imbalanced data via class_weight
- Time-based train/test splits to mimic streaming data
- Evaluation: macro F1 and PR-AUC for imbalanced tasks
- Canary rollout and monitoring basics for production safety

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo-code: outline of pipeline components
function buildPipeline(){
  const vectorizer = new TFIDF({ngramRange:[1,2], maxFeatures:100000});
  const model = new LogisticRegression({classWeight:'balanced'});
  return {vectorizer, model};
}
```

